{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">a Fishing game with a Rhythm gimmick!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">REEL TO THE BEAT!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reeling is essential! and you must reel to the beat of the song!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Catch several fishes each with their own original song!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">a Cute Retro 3D graphic!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore strange locations in the lake, how much deeper does this lake go?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Future Planned features :</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Custom fish editor: create your own fish and song then release it in a community pond for other players to enjoy!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More strange area, more fish gimmick,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cosmetics that you can obtain by exploring or perfecting a certain number of fishes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Story :</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a curious fisher who felt the calling to come to this mysterious lake.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fish here are affected my the power of the mermaid. and you must learn to sync with their music in order to fish them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">eventually you will find out how much deeper this lake can go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3600990?t=1745487376","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3600990?t=1745487376","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600990/873ed0f9adfe61bf491de98b142e0b58844ae5b0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745487376","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600990/873